  "description": {
    "zh": "該序列由不同的正整數組成，並以數字 0 結尾。確定該序列中第二大元素的值。保證序列至少有兩個元素。 <p><strong>C++ 注意：</strong>對於以零結尾的輸入，請勿包含終止零。當結果可能是小數時，請使用 double。 </p>",
    "en": "The sequence consists of distinct positive integer numbers and ends with the number 0. Determine the value of the second largest element in this sequence. It is guaranteed that the sequence has at least two elements.<p><strong>C++ note:</strong> For zero-terminated input, do not include the terminating zero. Use double when the result may be fractional.</p>"
  },
  "hint": {
